Vesting Schedule

· Vesting Type: Cliff vesting — tokens are released all at once after a set waiting period
· Full Unlock Schedule: Extends into 2027

Per Kategori:

DAO Treasury

· Cliff: Ditetapkan per proposal
· Vesting: Bervariasi; beberapa alokasi menggunakan cliff 24 bulan
· Unlock Frequency: Peristiwa unlock terjadwal
· Current Status: Ongoing

Team & Advisors

· Cliff: 1 tahun
· Vesting: 4 tahun linear
· Unlock Frequency: Bertahap
· Current Status: Ongoing

Investors

· Cliff: Ya (periode tidak dispesifikasi)
· Vesting: Multi-year
· Unlock Frequency: Bertahap
· Current Status: Ongoing

Next Scheduled Unlock: 16 Juli 2026 (dilepaskan ke Arbitrum DAO Treasury)

